+Use case: stylized-concept
+Asset type: original game-ready fictional masked security enemy animation atlas.
+Input image1 is our approved original Yakudza pixel sprite sheet, ONLY a style/camera/scale reference. Do NOT reproduce Yakudza's identifiable face, hair, obesity, phone, or clothes. No real person's photograph is an input. Enemy is fictional and anonymous behind full mask. No real organization symbols, text, badges, uniforms or copied game assets.
+Create a polished original pixel-art enemy with the role/design specified below. Compact readable full-body silhouette, compatible with approved reference scale and cluster shading. Top-down steep overhead game camera: see TOP of head/helmet, shoulders and upper torso, with short foreshortened legs. NOT a side-platformer paper doll. All4 directions use the SAME overhead camera. Leave full transparent space around actor; maximum38px width and52px height inside48x64 logical frame.
+Layout EXACT8 columns4 rows,32 full-body sprites, transparent1536x1024 canvas. Each192x256cell represents48x64 pixel drawing at EXACT4x nearest-neighbor presentation: every logical pixel is crisp4x4 solid square. Grid no gaps. Centeractor logicalx24, foot baseliney58. No actor overlaps or clips cell borders.
+Rows top to bottom: DOWN toward viewer/bottom of image; LEFT; RIGHT; UP away from viewer (back of helmet/head visible). Eight frames per row. Columns0,1 standing ready idle with subtle breathing;2,3,4,5,6,7 six distinct walking cycle poses, alternating left/right foot and natural arm movement. At least4 visibly distinct steps in every direction. Keep helmet, clothing, equipment and proportions coherent across32frames. All actors same scale. Feet and top of head not jumping dramatically, no extra limbs.
+TRUE low-resolution pixel art drawn as intentional square clusters, hard staircase edges, narrow near-black purple outlines and restrained high-contrast flat shadow ramps. NO antialiasing, gradients, soft shadow, photography, realistic texture or painted brush. Maximum32 shared colors. Transparent background with actual zero alpha outside sprite, no floor shadow, glow, matte or checkerboard. No labels, writing, grid lines, UI, watermark, text, scenery or extra characters. Original gritty action aesthetic; do not copy characters or sprites from any existing game.
