+Create an EXACT8-column4-row sprite atlas on transparent1536x1024 canvas. Every192x256cell represents48x64 native pixel drawing enlarged EXACT4x NEAREST: deliberate crisp4x4 solid-color square clusters, hard staircase edges, no antialiasing/soft gradients. Same scale as reference1, but each pose fully contained with generous transparent margins. Maximum42logical pixels wide and54high, center horizontalx24, standing foot baseliney58. No cropping of hair, arms, phone or lying body. True steep overhead top-down game camera: top of hair and broad shoulders visible, legs foreshortened. NEVER side-platformer illustration or portrait bust.
